	</SCRIPT_INFO>
	<DATAIO_INFO>
		<TRID_INFO>
			<TRAN tranid="obtrc_oder_001a" trcode="obtrc_oder_001a" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" digitalsign="1" useattr="0" />
			<TRAN tranid="obtrc_oder_005r" trcode="obtrc_oder_005r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
			<TRAN tranid="obrtd_drng_036r" trcode="obrtd_drng_036r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obtrc_oder_001a" title="국내CFD_주문 처리" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="837" _ulen="619" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0
ISCD^종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
ODER_UNPR^주문단가^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
ODQT^주문수량^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
ODER_CLS_CODE^주문구분코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
